;
;----------- テスト選択肢付き -------------
;イメージチェンジしてみたって言ってくる話

; 作業部屋指定
[focusroom address={[0,0]}]

; 初期配置
[popchara name=kitty relative=1 x=0 angle=0]
[movecamera type=1 z=11 y=-1.7]
; 手振り
[wait time=500]
[startanime name=kitty time=2000 script=tefuri]
[balloon name=kitty time=5000]
[wait time=500]ねぇねぇ！
[waitaction name=kitty script=tefuri]
[endballoon name=kitty]
[wait time=1300]

[startanime name=kitty time=4000 script=kurukuru]
[balloon name=kitty time=5000]
みてみてー！[r][wait time=1000]どうかしら？
[waitaction name=kitty script=kurukuru]
[endballoon name=kitty]

[wait time=300]

[startanime name=kitty time=3000 script=hokori]
[balloon name=kitty time=3000]
[wait time=500]お洋服を[r]きがえてみたのよ！
[waitaction name=kitty script=hokori]
[endballoon name=kitty]
[wait time=1000]
[branch target={"*select1"} text={"すっごく可愛い！"}]
[branch target={"*select2"} text={"とっても似合ってる！"}]
[branch target={"*select3"} text={"あれ？髪の毛きった？"}]
[wait time=2000]
[s]

; 分岐処理

*select1
[startanime name=kitty time=5000 script=tere]
[balloon name=kitty time=3000]
[wait time=500]そんなに褒められると[r]はずかしくなっちゃうー！
[waitaction name=kitty script=tere]
[endballoon name=kitty]
[jump target={"*branch_end"}]


*select2
[startanime name=kitty time=7500 script=picture_kansou_event script_args={[3,"kiraniko"]}]
[balloon name=kitty time=6000]
[wait time=1000]ほんと？[r][wait time=2000]とってもうれしいわ！
[waitaction name=kitty script=picture_kansou_event]
[endballoon name=kitty]
[jump target={"*branch_end"}]


*select3
[startanime name=kitty time=6000 script=plant_nagameru_set script_args={[2,"bikkuri"]}]
[balloon name=kitty time=6000]
ええっ！？[r][wait time=1500]・・・[wait time=1500]髪の毛は[r]かわってないのよ～～～！
[waitaction name=kitty script=plant_nagameru_set]
[endballoon name=kitty]
[jump target={"*branch_end"}]


*branch_end
[wait time=1000]
[startanime name=kitty time=5300 script=lampstand_manzoku_set script_args={[3,"smile4","manzoku"]}]
[balloon name=kitty time=5000]
[wait time=500]また一緒に[r][wait time=1500]お話ししましょ！
[waitaction name=kitty script=lampstand_manzoku_set]
[endballoon name=kitty]
[wait time=500]
[startanime name=kitty time=2000 script=tefuri]
[waitaction name=kitty script=tefuri]

[wait time=1000]


